# STAC API metadata (landing page title and description)
STAC_FASTAPI_TITLE=🔵 Kanopia STAC API
STAC_FASTAPI_DESCRIPTION="[https://kanopia.org/](https://kanopia.org/) is a collective of researchers studying canopy biodiversity with drones and AI.\n\nData are organized into projects (STAC Collections), with each project containing one or more drone missions (STAC Items). Drone missions include different products (STAC Assets), such as orthomosaics, digital surface models, and/or point clouds.\n\nAll metadata are publicly viewable and findable, but most assets are private and password-protected. Low-resolution versions of private rasters (but not point clouds) are publicly accessible.\n\nOnly drone products are currently available via this STAC API. Individual drone photos and vector data are stored elsewhere.\n\nThe Kanopia STAC Catalog can be accessed in QGIS using this link: [https://www.kanopia.org/stac-fastapi-pgstac/api/v1/pgstac/#/](https://www.kanopia.org/stac-fastapi-pgstac/api/v1/pgstac/#/)\n\nPlease contact us ([contact@kanopia.org](mailto:contact@kanopia.org)) with any questions and data access requests."
